Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz16.02\pos(883.516,266.922)}我的名字是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz16.02\pos(1011.668,289.804)}天音莉莉!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz17.34\pos(972.765,502.6)}作響的Lyric
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\pos(1052.861,603.279)\frz18.23}這個Loud SOUL喲!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz17.34\pos(1119.226,651.329)}禿頭的傢伙基本上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.30,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz17.34\pos(1071.168,731.414)}都是朋友!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz18.06\pos(1114.648,349.296)}快要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz17.45\pos(1219.917,447.686)}你與它的時間!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\1c&H000000&\bord0\pos(995.65,761.161)\frz17.85}項圈和皮膚融合成為一體!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz19.97\pos(1409.858,765.738)}就算這樣這份心緒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:56.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\1c&H000000&\bord0\frz20.06\pos(1373.243,928.196)}也不會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:04.56,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\1c&H000000&\bord0\pos(1132.957,246.331)}偷偷瞄了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:04.56,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\1c&H000000&\bord0\pos(1066.592,330.993)}拍了照片
